WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.600
Draw a box around Dorian's stall near the Bahamas.

00:05.600 --> 00:08.600
Add a comment and attach the marked region.

00:08.600 --> 00:13.425
Open the actual captured image before sending it.

00:13.425 --> 00:19.200
Ask for a close-up PNG with both peak UTC labels.

00:19.200 --> 00:29.900
Actual agent work is accelerated to 8x speed.

00:29.900 --> 00:39.700
The first figure appears directly in the answer. Open it to review.

00:39.700 --> 00:46.300
Ask for detailed coastlines and a tighter close-up.

00:46.300 --> 00:54.100
Actual review work is accelerated to 8x speed.

00:54.100 --> 00:58.100
The refined figure appears beside its question and answer.

00:58.100 --> 01:03.500
Open the complete figure with both correct peak UTC labels.
